        "hypothesis": "When there are at least four requested nodes, parallelizing their independent recursive cost calculations can use the four CPU cores. Dynamic scheduling can balance queries with different path lengths; serial tokenization and ordered printing preserve output behavior, while the threshold avoids launching a parallel team for smaller lists.",
